flowchart TD
    Start([POST /api/v1/transaction-invoices/batch]) --> CheckCash
    CheckCash{cashInOutId not empty?}
    CheckCash -->|No| ErrCash[400 Bad Request: cashInOutId required]
    CheckCash -->|Yes| CheckParams
    CheckParams{accountCategoryIds provided?}
    CheckParams -->|No| ErrParams[400 Bad Request: accountCategoryIds required]
    CheckParams -->|Yes| ValidateValues
    ValidateValues{All IDs valid format?}
    ValidateValues -->|No| ErrValues[400 Bad Request: invalid accountCategoryId format]
    ValidateValues -->|Yes| Process
    Process[Begin Batch Processing]
    Process --> Loop{For each accountCategoryId}
    Loop --> Lookup[Lookup AccountCategory in DB]
    Lookup --> Found{Found?}
    Found -->|No| RecordFail[Record failure: account not found]
    Found -->|Yes| Insert[INSERT TransactionInvoice]
    Insert --> RecordSuccess[Record success with invoiceId]
    RecordFail --> Loop
    RecordSuccess --> Loop
    Loop --> Complete([201 Created: BatchTransactionInvoiceResultDto])
    ErrCash --> End([End])
    ErrParams --> End
    ErrValues --> End
    Complete --> End
